config BR2_PACKAGE_MU_CELL_BB_DTS
    bool "mu-cell-bb-dts"
    help
      Compiles and installs the Device Tree overlay for the µCell BB
      HAT into /boot/overlays/mu-cell-bb_raspberrypi.dtbo.

      The RPi bootloader loads this overlay either because config.txt
      contains  dtoverlay=mu-cell-bb_raspberrypi  or because the HAT
      EEPROM's dt_blob field names it (automatic HAT detection).

      Source: https://github.com/Jankyneering/mu-cell-bb-drivers